category: Clusters|General
description: >
  Implementation of the Alarm Base Server Cluster.
  The user has to enable the Alarm Base Server Cluster in the ZCL Advanced Platform (ZAP) tool in order to enable this functionality.
id: matter_alarm_base
package: matter
label: Alarm Base Server Cluster
quality: production
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: "Apache 2.0"
provides:
  - name: matter_alarm_base
source:
  - path: third_party/matter_sdk/src/app/clusters/alarm-base-server/AlarmBaseCluster.cpp
include:
  - path: third_party/matter_sdk/src/app/clusters/alarm-base-server
    file_list:
      - path: alarm-base-cluster-objects.h
      - path: AlarmBaseCluster.h
      - path: Delegate.h
template_contribution:
  - name: component_catalog
    value: matter_alarm_base